    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use this object to coordinate user interface updates on the main queue with a [`AVCapturePhotoOutput`](avcapturephotooutput.md) that runs on a background queue.",
      "ko": "이 객체를 사용해 메인 큐의 사용자 인터페이스 업데이트를 백그라운드 큐에서 실행되는 [`AVCapturePhotoOutput`](avcapturephotooutput.md)와 조정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e01a2703adf76c799adacad5ed14ec900f5215779f62b9fad6080dd2582a1578",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "Adopt the [`AVCapturePhotoOutputReadinessCoordinatorDelegate`](avcapturephotooutputreadinesscoordinatordelegate.md) protocol in your app and set its implementation as the coordinator’s delegate object to receive callbacks as the associated photo output’s [`captureReadiness`](avcapturephotooutput/capturereadiness-swift.property.md) state changes.",
      "ko": "[`AVCapturePhotoOutputReadinessCoordinatorDelegate`](avcapturephotooutputreadinesscoordinatordelegate.md) 프로토콜을 앱에서 채택하고 구현을 조정기의 delegate 객체로 설정하면, 연결된 사진 출력의 [`captureReadiness`](avcapturephotooutput/capturereadiness-swift.property.md) 상태 변경 시 콜백을 받을 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d8c081b380383f70466424e3958d34616d0f04d05219d35c1a1ab69df001033b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "You can track additional capture requests with this object by calling its [`startTrackingCaptureRequest(using:)`](avcapturephotooutputreadinesscoordinator/starttrackingcapturerequest(using:).md) method.",
      "ko": "이 객체의 [`startTrackingCaptureRequest(using:)`](avcapturephotooutputreadinesscoordinator/starttrackingcapturerequest(using:).md) 메서드를 호출해 추가 캡처 요청을 추적할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5d46b00151f4cf5643cc087e9fe6a3e231d94a2140d870b190136b3509e5110f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0002",
      "source": "You can use it to synchronously update shutter button availability and appearance and on the main thread while calling the photo output’s [`capturePhoto(with:delegate:)`](avcapturephotooutput/capturephoto(with:delegate:).md) method asynchronously on a background queue.",
      "ko": "백그라운드 큐에서 사진 출력의 [`capturePhoto(with:delegate:)`](avcapturephotooutput/capturephoto(with:delegate:).md) 메서드를 비동기로 호출하는 동안, 메인 스레드에서 셔터 버튼의 사용 가능 여부와 모양을 동기적으로 업데이트하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "19501be2bef79857855f1ded39cf6079dcfdbf3ec53759257e49b11a2fe8d3b9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
